Modifications
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

As required by section 4(b) of the Apache License, notice is given that this
work contains modifications to the above. The changes are substantial: the
Porkbun API client and the solver were rewritten, the Helm chart was reworked,
and the build, test and release tooling was replaced.

CHANGELOG.md enumerates the changes in full. Files that remain closely derived
from upstream carry a comment identifying their origin.

